#### 5. [`Concrete.lean:9-11`](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/ro-A1/Concrete.lean#L9-L11), [`Concrete/SpecDiffRandom.lean`](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/ro-A1/Concrete/SpecDiffRandom.lean), [`Concrete/SpecDiffSpecGen.lean`](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/ro-A1/Concrete/SpecDiffSpecGen.lean), [`Concrete/SpecDiffBirGen.lean`](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/ro-A1/Concrete/SpecDiffBirGen.lean), [`Concrete/README.md:189-191`](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/ro-A1/Concrete/README.md#L189-L191) — **MEDIUM**
**Test generators live in `Concrete/` and are imported by the compiler library root [`Concrete.lean`](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/ro-A1/Concrete.lean).**

- **Why this is a problem:**
  1. **Layout rules ([`Concrete/README.md:154-155, 202-205`](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/ro-A1/Concrete/README.md#L154-L205)):** `Concrete/` is reserved for compiler pipeline stages ("one flat folder, one file per pipeline stage or concern"), whereas compiler gates belong in `scripts/checks/compiler/`.
  2. **Future Gate 2 ([`Concrete/README.md:556-562`](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/ro-A1/Concrete/README.md#L556-L562)):** When [`scripts/proofs/axioms.sh`](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/ro-A1/scripts/proofs/axioms.sh), [`scripts/proofs/trust_ban.sh`](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/ro-A1/scripts/proofs/trust_ban.sh), [`scripts/proofs/kernel_replay.sh`](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/ro-A1/scripts/proofs/kernel_replay.sh), and [`scripts/proofs/external.sh`](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/ro-A1/scripts/proofs/external.sh) are extended to `Concrete`, they enumerate the entire import closure of `Concrete.lean`; importing `SpecDiff*` in `Concrete.lean` pulls test generators into the compiler's constant/module inventory and kernel/external replay closure.
  3. **Build coupling ([`scripts/checks/lib/slice0_sources.sh`](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/ro-A1/scripts/checks/lib/slice0_sources.sh)):** Every compiler gate runs `lake build Concrete`, so generator edits rebuild the compiler library. (Gate 9's [`tests/golden/slice0_trusted_base.txt`](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/ro-A1/tests/golden/slice0_trusted_base.txt) is unaffected today only because [`Concrete/Premises.lean`](file:///home/unbalancedparen/projects/gates-briefs/ro-A1/Concrete/Premises.lean) does not import `SpecDiff*`.)

**Concrete fix (best placement):**
